# TFIXU 3 / ui 7: crossing the 250 ms threshold starts a SEL clear and consumes SEL. Releasing
# before the 1.5 s ring fills keeps the clip AND must not fall through to the ordinary SEL tap,
# which would queue a launch.
wait 300
expect clipused0 1
press SEL
wait 500                       # past the hold threshold, well under the clear
release SEL
wait 120
expect clipused0 1
expect liveque0 -1
expect livestop0 0
dump studio_clear_sel_abort.json
